{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "取消视频任务",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "网关统一异步视频任务取消接口。当前支持 BytePlus（Seedance 等字节跳动视频模型）与 MiniMax Overseas H3 两个渠道。",
    "license": {
      "name": "Project License",
      "url": "https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/blob/main/LICENSE"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://baze-api.powerbuyin.top",
      "description": "Baze API 服务地址"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Hailuo Video",
      "description": "Hailuo 视频任务状态查询与取消"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/videos/{task_id}": {
      "delete": {
        "summary": "取消视频任务",
        "description": "取消仍在队列中的异步视频任务。当前支持 BytePlus（Seedance 系列）与 MiniMax Overseas H3 两个渠道。\n\n调用前需满足以下条件，任一条件不满足时网关不会触达上游 DELETE，直接返回错误：\n\n1. 任务属于受支持渠道（BytePlus `platform=58` 或 MiniMax Overseas H3 `platform=59`）。\n2. 网关会先查询上游真实状态，只有当上游任务仍在队列中时才允许取消。BytePlus 放行 `pending` / `queued` / `submitted`，MiniMax H3 放行 `queued`；运行中或已进入终态的任务返回 400。\n3. 任务未被软删除，且只能操作当前账号创建的任务。\n\n取消成功后，网关按渠道规则同步本地任务状态（`CANCELLED` 或软删除），并触发对应的计费终态处理。响应状态码与响应体由网关原样透传上游 DELETE 结果；建议随后再调用 `GET /v1/videos/{task_id}` 确认任务已进入终态。\n\n### 支持渠道\n\n当前仅以下两个渠道支持取消（去掉）视频任务：\n\n| 渠道 | platform | 上游 DELETE 端点 | 放行的上游队列状态 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| BytePlus（Seedance 系列） | `58` | `DELETE /api/v3/contents/generations/tasks/{id}` | `pending` `queued` `submitted` |\n| MiniMax Overseas H3 | `59` | `DELETE /v2/video_generation/{task_id}` | `queued` |\n\nKling、Vidu、Ali（百炼）、Sora 等其他渠道暂不支持，调用会返回 400 `unsupported_platform`，且不会触达上游。\n\n请求示例：\n\n```bash\ncurl -X DELETE \"https://baze-api.powerbuyin.top/v1/videos/task_abc123xyz\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer sk-your-token\"\n```",
        "operationId": "cancelVideoTask",
        "tags": [
          "Hailuo Video"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "task_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "待取消的任务 ID。必须是本网关公开的任务 ID（`tasks.task_id`），不是上游 `provider_task_id`。只能取消当前账号创建的任务"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "取消成功。网关原样透传上游 DELETE 的状态码与响应体。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CancelVideoTaskResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "byteplus_cancelled": {
                    "summary": "BytePlus 取消成功",
                    "value": {
                      "id": "upstream_task_id",
                      "status": "cancelled"
                    }
                  },
                  "minimax_cancelled": {
                    "summary": "MiniMax H3 取消成功",
                    "value": {
                      "action": "cancel",
                      "status": "cancelled"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "前置条件不满足，网关自行组装错误响应，不会触达上游 DELETE。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "task_not_queueing": {
                    "summary": "上游任务非队列中",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "task_not_queueing",
                        "message": "upstream task status is running, only queued tasks can be cancelled",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "unsupported_platform": {
                    "summary": "渠道不支持取消",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "unsupported_platform",
                        "message": "task cancellation is not supported for this platform",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "invalid_request": {
                    "summary": "请求参数无效",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "invalid_request",
                        "message": "task_id is required",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "鉴权失败，例如未提供令牌或令牌无效。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "unauthorized": {
                    "summary": "未授权",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "access_denied",
                        "message": "无效的令牌",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "任务不存在、不属于当前账号，或查询上游状态时上游返回 404。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "task_not_found": {
                    "summary": "任务不存在",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "task_not_found",
                        "message": "task not found",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "upstream_task_not_found": {
                    "summary": "上游任务不存在",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "upstream_task_not_found",
                        "message": "upstream task not found",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "网关内部处理失败，例如查询本地任务或渠道信息失败。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "db_error": {
                    "summary": "查询本地任务失败",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "db_error",
                        "message": "failed to query task",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "channel_not_found": {
                    "summary": "渠道配置缺失",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "channel_not_found",
                        "message": "channel not found",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "网关访问上游时发生网络故障。请求可能未成功发出，客户端可主动重试。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "upstream_query_failed": {
                    "summary": "查询上游状态失败",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "upstream_query_failed",
                        "message": "failed to query upstream task status",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "upstream_request_failed": {
                    "summary": "上游 DELETE 请求失败",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "upstream_request_failed",
                        "message": "failed to request upstream cancellation",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "upstream_read_failed": {
                    "summary": "读取上游响应失败",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "upstream_read_failed",
                        "message": "failed to read upstream response",
                        "type": "invalid_request_error"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "JWT",
        "description": "在请求头中传入 `Authorization: Bearer <token>`。"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "CancelVideoTaskResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "取消结果由上游原样返回，不同渠道字段略有差异。",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "上游任务 ID（BytePlus）。"
          },
          "task_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "上游任务 ID（MiniMax H3）。"
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "执行的操作（MiniMax H3），例如 `cancel`。"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "操作结果：`cancelled`（取消成功）或 `deleted`（记录已删除）。",
            "enum": [
              "cancelled",
              "deleted"
            ]
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误码，如 `task_not_queueing`、`unsupported_platform`、`task_not_found`。"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误说明。"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误类型，例如 `invalid_request_error`。"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
